Delay 4 ms
MoveR -8 14
Delay 4 ms
MoveR -8 14
Delay 4 ms
MoveR -8 14
Delay 4 ms
MoveR -8 14
Delay 4 ms
MoveR -8 14
Delay 4 ms
MoveR -8 14
LeftUp 1
Delay 20 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rust</Software>
